### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Landing content + analytics — manual test script
### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client)
### and JetBrains HTTP Client. Run `npm run seed` first so there is content.
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@api = {{baseUrl}}/api/v1
@adminSecret = change-me-to-a-long-random-string

### 1. Everything the home + about pages render (public, cached 60 s)
GET {{api}}/landing-data

### 2. Settings (public)
GET {{api}}/settings

### 3. Set the academy WhatsApp number and email (admin) — deep merge, other settings are kept
PATCH {{api}}/settings
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{adminSecret}}

{
  "contact": {
    "whatsappNumber": "+20 100 123 4567",
    "email": "info@mazeed.academy",
    "socialLinks": { "facebook": "https://facebook.com/mazeed" }
  }
}

### 4. Update the stats card (admin) — arrays are replaced as a whole
PATCH {{api}}/settings
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{adminSecret}}

{
  "stats": [
    { "icon": "faCalendarDays", "value": 3, "label": "حلقات يومية منتظمة" },
    { "icon": "faCircleCheck", "value": 5, "label": "فروع معتمدة" },
    { "icon": "faUsers", "value": 25, "label": "محفظ ومحفظة", "key": "teachers" }
  ]
}

### 5. Public lists
GET {{api}}/services

###
GET {{api}}/pricing-plans

###
GET {{api}}/showcase?tab=reports

###
GET {{api}}/testimonials

### 6. Admin list including hidden items
GET {{api}}/services?includeInactive=true
x-admin-secret: {{adminSecret}}

### 7. Create a service (admin)
# @name createService
POST {{api}}/services
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{adminSecret}}

{
  "icon": "faBookQuran",
  "badge": "جديد",
  "title": "حلقات المراجعة الصيفية",
  "description": "برنامج مكثف لتثبيت المحفوظ خلال الإجازة الصيفية.",
  "link": "سجّل الآن",
  "order": 10
}

###
@serviceId = {{createService.response.body.data.id}}

### 8. Hide it (admin)
PATCH {{api}}/services/{{serviceId}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{adminSecret}}

{ "isActive": false }

### 9. Delete it (admin)
DELETE {{api}}/services/{{serviceId}}
x-admin-secret: {{adminSecret}}

### 10. Add a certificate photo to the showcase (admin)
POST {{api}}/showcase
Content-Type: application/json
x-admin-secret: {{adminSecret}}

{
  "tab": "certificates",
  "title": "إجازة برواية ورش",
  "caption": "بالسند المتصل",
  "image": "https://cdn.example.com/certificates/warsh.webp"
}

### 11. Page view (public) — what the site sends on each route change
POST {{api}}/analytics/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventType": "page_view", "pagePath": "/about" }

### 12. WhatsApp click on a service (public) — use a real id from GET /services
POST {{api}}/analytics/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventType": "service_whatsapp_click", "serviceType": "service", "serviceId": "PUT_A_SERVICE_ID_HERE", "pagePath": "/" }

### 12b. WhatsApp click on a general button (public)
POST {{api}}/analytics/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventType": "general_whatsapp_click", "placement": "hero", "pagePath": "/" }

### 13. Personal data is rejected → expect 400
POST {{api}}/analytics/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "eventType": "page_view", "pagePath": "/", "name": "أحمد", "phone": "201112223333" }

### 14. Stats summary (admin)
GET {{api}}/analytics/summary
x-admin-secret: {{adminSecret}}

### 15. Stats summary without the secret → expect 401
GET {{api}}/analytics/summary
